sequenceDiagram
    title Rafiki integration with Wallet - Gatehub provider
    autonumber
    participant Ra as Rafiki
    participant Wb as Wallet Backend
    participant Ga as GateHub
    participant Db as Wallet Backend DB

    Note over Ra,Wb: Sender and receiver are on the same Rafiki instance

    %% Incoming: created
    Ra->>Wb: incoming_payment.created webhook
    Wb->>Db: INSERT rafiki_incoming_payments

    %% Outgoing: created
    Ra->>Wb: outgoing_payment.created webhook
    Wb->>Wb: Parse and validate payload
    Wb->>Wb: getAccounts lookup sender receiver linked accounts

    alt Payment invalid
        Wb->>Ra: CancelOutgoingPayment
        Note right of Wb: account not found, same wallet, insufficient balance, or reserve failed
    else Payment valid
        alt Immediate payment amt >= 100
            Wb->>Ga: GetBalance sender
            Wb->>Wb: Create payment and Confirm
            Wb->>Ra: FundOutgoingPayment
        else Batched payment amt less than 100
            Wb->>Wb: reserveTransfer reserve 26h
            Wb->>Db: INSERT rafiki_outgoing_payments
            Wb->>Ra: FundOutgoingPayment
        end
    end

    Ra->>Ra: Process payment ILP quote transfer
    Ra->>Wb: outgoing_payment.completed webhook

    Wb->>Wb: Parse and validate lookup sender
    Wb->>Db: EXISTS rafiki_outgoing_payments
    alt Batched payment row exists
        Wb->>Ga: FinaliseReserve debit sender to intermediary
    end
    Wb->>Ra: WithdrawOutgoingPaymentLiquidity

    %% Incoming: completed or expired or partial
    Ra->>Wb: incoming_payment.completed or expired or partial_payment_received
    Wb->>Wb: Parse and validate lookup receiver
    Wb->>Ga: AssignBalance credit receiver from intermediary
    Wb->>Ra: WithdrawIncomingPaymentLiquidity
    Wb->>Db: UPDATE rafiki_incoming_payments
